backend/lcd_render.py and resources/ are taken verbatim from OpenKraken
(https://github.com/davidboulay/OpenKraken, MIT, see LICENSE-OpenKraken) so the
"All sensors" (triple) screen matches it exactly. Only the compositing over a
GIF background and the q565 streaming live in ../kraken_unleashed/.

Local tweaks to backend/lcd_render.py (diverging from upstream):
  - triple screen: liquid arc/track removed (the GIF background provides the rim)
  - triple screen: vendor badges enlarged (size 20 -> 30)
  - Intel badge blue brightened (0,113,197) -> (0,160,255)
